## Fact baseline (source-derived only)
- Schema audit: **54,674,003** rows across 9 × 34 field sets. `ARR_DELAY>=15`: **10,116,916** source records, approximately **18.5041%** of finite audit `ARR_DELAY`; **not** Spark output.
- Full time representation audit is 2016–2023 processed, `2400_SEMANTICS_NOT_PROVEN`; not 2024. No raw CSV read/updated in this docs release.
- No verified raw SHA256, dataset representative coverage, flight grain, units for 7 CORE numeric measures, Weather units/join, or deployment environment. Historic T-2h/ATL ML policies do not govern retrospective KPIs.

## Next safe work sequence
1. T-001 provenance, T-002 grain, T-003 units and **8 CORE KPI lock**; independent T-004 safe-time audit. T-005 Weather conditional may be approved NO-GO without stalling CORE.
2. Review G2 exit with actual citations, then G3 design T-006; after G3, G4 begins at T-009 setup followed by T-007/008 coding.
